t venture out, gather ingredients, and brew magical potions to restore her strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey Together</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hela encourages you to work hand-in-hand to overcome the challenges that lie ahead. Play solo or with friends through local split-screen multiplayer or online co-op as you delve into lush, vibrant vistas together, from rugged mountains trails, through magical forests, to tranquil lakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/6cb452af60c428ee0aab9818e4299236.poster.avif?t=1767871620\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/6cb452af60c428ee0aab9818e4299236.webm?t=1767871620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/6cb452af60c428ee0aab9818e4299236.mp4?t=1767871620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Craft Your Tale</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this enchanting world as you glide through the air, collecting items, solve puzzles, and face the adversity of the natural world. The more you explore, the more story fragments you'll discover. Weave your own story by performing acts of kindness, feeling your impact ripple through the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/231b39f2edf401d055000571cbbbfcfc.poster.avif?t=1767871620\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/231b39f2edf401d055000571cbbbfcfc.webm?t=176787162